    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Eighteen and over · From £680\",\"title\":\"Adult circumcision\",\"lede\":\"We provide adult circumcision for a wide range of reasons, including religious and cultural choice, personal preference and medical foreskin problems such as phimosis. We also assess men who are unhappy with a previous circumcision and want revision or re-circumcision.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidar\\u0022\\u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)\\u003c/a\\u003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Who we see\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\"},{\"label\":\"Adult men\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The circumcision is carried out under local anaesthetic. You remain awake and can talk to the practitioner, watch videos or listen to music. We allow the anaesthetic time to work and check the area before the procedure begins.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For adults we commonly use the forceps-guided method with thermal cautery. Depending on the individual case, the wound may be closed with dissolvable stitches and/or skin glue.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"At a glance\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Anaesthetic\",\"v\":\"Local anaesthetic\"},{\"k\":\"During\",\"v\":\"Awake; talk, videos or music\"},{\"k\":\"Common method\",\"v\":\"Forceps-guided with thermal cautery\"},{\"k\":\"Closure\",\"v\":\"Dissolvable stitches and/or skin glue\"},{\"k\":\"Follow-up\",\"v\":\"Available during the healing period if needed\"},{\"k\":\"Price\",\"v\":\"£680, £880 or £1,080\"}],\"note\":\"From £680, or £880 with frenulum removal, or £1,080 with a medical or foreskin problem. See the \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/prices/\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003efull price list\\u003c/a\\u003e, broken down by age band.\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Before you come\",\"heading\":\"Preparation\",\"html\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cul\\u003e\\n          \\u003cli\\u003eBring photo ID.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n          \\u003cli\\u003eBring close-fitting underwear such as tight V shaped briefs.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n          \\u003cli\\u003eShave clean the pubic area.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n          \\u003cli\\u003eBuy a 250ml tub of Vaseline.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n          \\u003cli\\u003eTell us in advance about medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n        \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n      \\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Afterwards\",\"heading\":\"Work and normal activities\",\"html\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cp\\u003eMany patients with desk-based work can return to work immediately, while physically demanding work may require more time away (usually 2 weeks). We can provide a work letter where appropriate. Follow the individual activity restrictions given to you after your procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":false} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Afterwards\",\"heading\":\"Aftercare\",\"html\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cp\\u003eBefore you leave, we explain the aftercare and give you written instructions. You can contact the clinic by telephone, WhatsApp or email if you have questions, and follow-up appointments are available during the healing period if needed. See the \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/\\u0022\\u003eaftercare page\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"\",\"heading\":\"Medical circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cp\\u003eAdult circumcision may be recommended after assessment for conditions such as \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\\u0022\\u003ephimosis\\u003c/a\\u003e, recurrent \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/balanitis/\\u0022\\u003ebalanitis\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/bxo/\\u0022\\u003eBXO/lichen sclerosus\\u003c/a\\u003e or other foreskin problems. We also assess \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/re-circumcision/\\u0022\\u003ere-circumcision or revision\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":false} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/figure {\"name\":\"certificates\",\"caption\":\"Qualifications hang in the corridor. Ask to see any of them.\",\"alt\":\"Framed qualifications along the clinic corridor at the Edgware practice.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us first\",\"formId\":\"adults\",\"subject\":\"adult men enquiry\",\"urgent\":true,\"urgentTitle\":\"If this is urgent, do not wait for an appointment\",\"urgentBody\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eGo to A\\u0026amp;E today if a pulled-back foreskin is trapped behind the head of the penis and swelling, if you or your child cannot pass urine, or if there is spreading redness with a fever. Those need treating in hours. For anything else, call \\u003ca href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-urgent\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep);font-weight:600\\u0022\\u003e020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e and tell us what is happening, and we will bring you forward if you need it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"title\":\"Ask us anything before you decide\",\"text\":\"Most people call with a question rather than to book. That is what the phone is for, and nothing is booked until you say so.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Also at this clinic\",\"heading\":\"Circumcision at other ages\",\"lede\":\"\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"exclude\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/adults/\",\"banded\":false,\"items\":[{\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\",\"title\":\"Babies and toddlers\",\"age\":\"Best under one month old\",\"price\":\"From £200\",\"cta\":\"Baby circumcision, from £200\",\"blurb\":\"The ring method, Plastibell or Circumplast, under local anaesthetic. About ten minutes, no stitches, and you take him home straight afterwards.\"},{\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/children/\",\"title\":\"Children and teenagers\",\"age\":\"One to seventeen years\",\"price\":\"From £280\",\"cta\":\"Circumcision for boys, from £280\",\"blurb\":\"The forceps guided method with thermal cautery, under local anaesthetic. School holiday appointments book up quickly.\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->"
